VALUES("STRUKTURA RAÈUNA, POSLANEGA V PREJŠNJEM LETU")=
"0 Število podjetij",
"1 Poslalo raèune v standardizirani strukturi, primerni za avtomatizirano obdelavo (e-raèune), v prejšnjem letu",
"1.1 Poslalo manj kot 10 % vseh raèunov v standardizirani strukturi, primerni za avtomatizirano obdelavo (e-raèune)",
"1.2 Poslalo vsaj 10 %, vendar manj kot 25 % vseh raèunov v standardizirani strukturi, primerni za avtomatizirano obdelavo (e-raèune)",
"1.3 Poslalo vsaj 25 %, vendar manj kot 50 % vseh raèunov v standardizirani strukturi, primerni za avtomatizirano obdelavo (e-raèune)",
"1.4 Poslalo vsaj 50 %, vendar manj kot 75 % vseh raèunov v standardizirani strukturi, primerni za avtomatizirano obdelavo (e-raèune)",
"1.5 Poslalo vsaj 75 % vseh raèunov v standardizirani strukturi, primerni za avtomatizirano obdelavo (e-raèune)",
"2 Poslalo raèune v elektronski obliki, ki ni primerna za avtomatizirano obdelavo (npr. e-pošta, priponka v formatu PDF), v prejšnjem letu",
"3 Poslalo raèune v papirnati obliki v prejšnjem letu";
VALUES[en]("STRUCTURE OF INVOICES SENT IN THE PREVIOUS YEAR")=
"0 Number of enterprises",
"1 Sent invoices in standard structure suitable for automated processing (e-invoices) in the previous year",
"1.1 Sent less than 10% of all invoices in standard structure suitable for automated processing (e-invoices)",
"1.2 Sent at least 10% but less than 25% of all invoices in standard structure suitable for automated processing (e-invoices)",
"1.3 Sent at least 25% but less than 50% of all invoices in standard structure suitable for automated processing (e-invoices)",
"1.4 Sent at least 50% but less than 75% of all invoices in standard structure suitable for automated processing (e-invoices)",
"1.5 Sent at least 75% of all invoices in standard structure suitable for automated processing (e-invoices)",
"2 Sent invoices in electronic form not suitable for automated processing (e.g. e-mail, attachment as PDF) in the previous year",
"3 Sent invoices in paper form in the previous year";
VALUES("VELIKOSTNI RAZRED PODJETJA")="10 ali veè zaposlenih in samozaposlenih",
